        <mxCell id="n24" value="The steps a person must perform are not a staffing choice. The platform's programming&#10;interface has no way to create a network link, no way to change a node's settings once it&#10;exists, and no way to delete anything; and choosing the machine to deploy onto spends one&#10;of the two slots the whole account has. Everything else here is scripted." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f9;strokeColor=#e3e5ea;fontColor=#3d3d46;fontSize=15.4;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="560" width="700" height="93.6" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
